                  <provenance type="#e"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_572">Welbeck,
                        Nottinghamshire. Premonstratensian abbey of St James</orgName><p>'Iste
                        liber constat sancte marie de Welbe[k]. Si quis hunc librum a predicta
                        Abathi[a] Alienaverit anatema sit. amen. Et scriptus erat Anno domini
                        millesimo ccccmo xxxmo secundo.' (fol. 163v, now fol. 126v).</p><p>Above the
                        name of the abbey has been written -- also in the 15th century: 'Domino
                        Roberto Prestwold' (MRJ Cat., p. 306). The book is no. 109 in the Handlist
                        of Engl. MSS. (1928), q. v.</p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Charles Clark, Tolham Hall, Essex (s.
                     xix).</provenance>
