                     21 June 1759.</provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Edmund Treherne's sale (Sotheby lot 1688) 28
                     Nov. 1861 -- see Seymour de Ricci's letter in Times Lit. Supp. 12 Feb.
                     1938.</provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Ownership marks of John Wildon on fol. 78v
                     (formerly fol. 91v), s. xv--xvi.</provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">'Thomas Gibbon' at foot of fol. iii recto (?
                     s. xvii--xviii).</provenance>
